    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't feel temporary though. it feels like the only truth i have left. everyone says \"it gets better\" or \"time heals,\" but they don't get it. why keep going through the cycle? you love something, you care for it, and then it's just... gone. and then you're just left sitting there waiting for the next thing to break. it feels so stupid to keep fighting just to reach the next inevitable loss.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
